---
---
<section id="pain-points" class="pain-points">
  <div class="container">

    <!-- Hero: 2 columnas -->
    <div class="pain-points__hero">

      <!-- Columna izquierda: texto principal -->
      <div class="pain-points__hero-text">
        <p class="pain-points__eyebrow">¿Te suena familiar?</p>
        <h1 class="pain-points__headline">
          Tu clínica merece algo mejor que papel, WhatsApp y hojas de cálculo
        </h1>
        <p class="pain-points__subheadline">
          <!-- TODO: Actualizar con dato real validado por el equipo -->
          La mayoría de clínicas dentales pequeñas pierden entre 10 y 20 minutos
          por paciente gestionando citas y expedientes de forma manual.
        </p>
        <button
          class="pain-points__cta"
          onclick="window.$crisp && window.$crisp.push(['do', 'chat:open'])"
          type="button"
        >
          Hablar con un asesor →
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Columna derecha: visual de impacto -->
      <div class="pain-points__hero-visual">
        <div class="pain-points__impact-card">
          <p class="pain-points__impact-label">Sin Consultorio Digital, cada semana:</p>
          <ul class="pain-points__impact-list">
            <li>
              <span class="impact-icon" aria-hidden="true">⏱️</span>
              <span>
                <strong>10–20 min perdidos</strong> por paciente buscando expedientes
              </span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="impact-icon" aria-hidden="true">💬</span>
              <span>
                <strong>Recordatorios manuales</strong> por WhatsApp que dependen de que alguien no olvide enviarlos
              </span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="impact-icon" aria-hidden="true">📋</span>
              <span>
                <strong>Citas duplicadas</strong> por manejo en papel o Excel sin sincronización
              </span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="impact-icon" aria-hidden="true">📁</span>
              <span>
                <strong>Expedientes dispersos</strong> entre papel, celular y correos sin orden
              </span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <!-- TODO: Reemplazar con dato real validado -->
          <div class="pain-points__impact-stat">
            <span class="stat-number">73%</span>
            <span class="stat-text">de clínicas pequeñas aún usan métodos manuales</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Cards de pain points -->
    <div class="pain-points__cards">

      <article class="pain-points__card">
        <!-- TODO: Reemplazar emoji con ícono SVG -->
        <div class="pain-points__card-icon" aria-hidden="true">📋</div>
        <h2 class="pain-points__card-title">Agendas en papel y Excel</h2>
        <p class="pain-points__card-body">
          Citas duplicadas, letra ilegible de terceros y búsquedas interminables.
          Cuando el cuaderno se pierde, la información del paciente desaparece contigo.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="pain-points__card">
        <!-- TODO: Reemplazar emoji con ícono SVG -->
        <div class="pain-points__card-icon" aria-hidden="true">💬</div>
        <h2 class="pain-points__card-title">Confirmaciones por WhatsApp</h2>
        <p class="pain-points__card-body">
          Mensajes sin respuesta, pacientes que no llegan y recordatorios manuales
          que dependen de que tú o tu asistente no olviden enviarlos ese día.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="pain-points__card">
        <!-- TODO: Reemplazar emoji con ícono SVG -->
        <div class="pain-points__card-icon" aria-hidden="true">📁</div>
        <h2 class="pain-points__card-title">Expedientes fragmentados</h2>
        <p class="pain-points__card-body">
          Radiografías en el celular, notas clínicas en papel y presupuestos en
          correos. Nadie tiene el cuadro completo del paciente a la mano cuando lo necesita.
        </p>
      </article>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .pain-points {
    background: var(--color-bg);
    padding: 0 0 var(--space-2xl);
  }

  /* Hero 2 columnas */
  .pain-points__hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    align-items: center;
    min-height: calc(90vh - var(--nav-height));
    padding: var(--space-xl) 0;
  }

  .pain-points__eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .pain-points__headline {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3.25rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .pain-points__subheadline {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .pain-points__cta {
    background: var(--color-cta);
    color: white;
    border: none;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    transition: background 0.15s, transform 0.1s;
  }

  .pain-points__cta:hover {
    background: var(--color-cta-dark);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  /* Tarjeta visual derecha */
  .pain-points__impact-card {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .pain-points__impact-label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .pain-points__impact-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .pain-points__impact-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    font-size: 0.925rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .impact-icon {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 0.1rem;
  }

  .pain-points__impact-list strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .pain-points__impact-stat {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: white;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
  }

  .stat-number {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .stat-text {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    opacity: 0.92;
  }

  /* Cards */
  .pain-points__cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  .pain-points__card {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-md);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .pain-points__card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .pain-points__card-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .pain-points__card-title {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .pain-points__card-body {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .pain-points__hero {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      min-height: auto;
      padding: var(--space-xl) 0 var(--space-md);
    }

    .pain-points__cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
